ub.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Add pure server-side biometric review transitions for exactly three attempts.\n- Rejection 1 and 2 each create a one-calendar-month retry boundary; rejection 3 permanently closes the sequence.\n- Acceptance is terminal; duplicate decisions, malformed state, member self-review, early retries and a forged fourth attempt are rejected.\n- Add focused state-machine tests for calendar boundaries and final closure.\n- Strengthen email-renewal Emulator integration coverage to prove that email renewal leaves the biometric verification record and its due timestamp unchanged.\n\n## Security and scope\nThe pure state machine does not itself authorize the reviewer. Any callable must enforce `requireOwnerForReview` (platform-owner claim plus MFA) before using it. This PR does not yet implement submission/review callables, private audio/video storage and access, audit persistence, biometric monthly renewal scheduling, or the exactly-once 1,500 BetaCoins award. Existing biometric verification remains fail-closed.\n\n## Validation\nGitHub Actions checks are running for the latest head. Do not merge until Cloud Functions compile/unit tests, email-renewal Emulator integration, biometric security integration, Flutter checks, and domain regression finish successfully on the exact head SHA.\n\nNo main merge, production deployment, Firebase production changes, billing, external tests or 5,000-persona simulation.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T14:26:21Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:53:30Z","closed_at":"2026-11-20T14:35:55Z","merged_at":"2026-11-20T14:35:55Z","merge_commit_sha":"1137c30066c76aaf074800d49211c5458036134d","assignee":null,"assign